      <article data-history-node-id="3447" about="/alabama-votes/voter/election-information/2026" typeof="schema:WebPage">

  
      <span property="schema:name" content="2026 Election Information" class="hidden"></span>


  
  <div>
    
            <div property="schema:text"><p>Welcome to the 2026 Election Information page! This page is the primary resource on the World Wide Web for information on elections in Alabama that are scheduled for the year 2026. The purpose of this page is to provide you a quick reference to answer questions you may have about such topics as voter registration, the dates of the elections, and voting procedures.<br><br>Use the links below to explore the information we have already posted and return on a regular basis to keep up with new information we will be posting for elections in 2026.</p><hr><h3>General Information and Resources</h3><blockquote><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/AdminCalendar%20-2026.pdf">Administrative Calendar</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026%20FCPA%20Filing%20Calendar%20(2).pdf">2026 FCPA Filing Calendar</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026-VoterGuide.pdf">2026 Voter Guide</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026CandidateFilingGuide.pdf">2026 Candidate Filing Guide</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/PhotoVoterIDGuide.pdf">Photo Voter ID Guide</a></p><p>Independent Candidates</p><ul><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e1ff7b3e380ae018d2c75ed98f52f06aa"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026%20Independent%20Candidate%20Ballot%20Access.pdf">Information for prospective independent candidates</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e74dd95f06551270de2ef9ed741add763"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/Independent%20Candidate%20Petition%20Form_0.pdf">Sample Petition - Independent Candidate</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e54f3275a53a1ea1dc9c36c8cb075b81d"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/Administrative%20rule%20governing%20ballot%20access%20petitions%20for%20prospective%20independent%20candidates.pdf"><span style="background-color:white;color:#124b91;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;">Administrative rule governing ballot access petitions for prospective independent candidates</span></a></li><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e87585a7f2db3c06152d23c16da2cd16b"><span style="background-color:white;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>Ballot access signature requirements for potential independent candidates</strong>&nbsp;<strong>seeking district offices at the federal or state levels in Alabama&nbsp;</strong>(i.e., U.S. Congress; State Senate; State House, and State School Board) are being recalculated by the Elections Division.&nbsp; The revised signature requirements will reflect the new district lines approved by the Alabama Legislature this year based on the 2020 U.S. Census.</span><span style="background-color:white;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>&nbsp;If you have a question about the signature requirement, please contact Jeff Elrod&nbsp;at the Elections Division by email at&nbsp;</strong></span><a href="mailto:jeff.elrod@sos.alabama.gov" target="_blank"><span style="background-color:white;color:#124b91;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>Jeff.Elrod@sos.alabama.gov</strong></span></a><span style="background-color:white;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>&nbsp;or by phone at 334-353-7177.</strong></span></li></ul><p>Minor Political Parties</p><ul><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e5b881446af83856a34c1aca4071fa741"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026%20Minor%20Party%20Ballot%20Access.pdf">Information for prospective minor political parties</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e7f6dadba5eb3fc826620d6e66e31a297"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/Administrative%20rule%20governing%20ballot%20access%20petitions%20for%20prospective%20minor%20political%20parties.pdf"><span style="background-color:white;color:#124b91;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;">Administrative rule governing ballot access petitions for prospective minor political parties</span></a></li><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e32e274cc7345a7d8915999468812a702"><span style="background-color:white;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>Ballot access signature requirements for potential minor political parties</strong>&nbsp;<strong>seeking to nominate candidates for district offices at the federal or state levels in Alabama&nbsp;</strong>(i.e., U.S. Congress; State Senate; State House, and State School Board) are being recalculated by the Elections Division.&nbsp;The revised signature requirements will reflect the new district lines approved by the Alabama Legislature this year based on the 2020 U.S. Census.</span><span style="background-color:white;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong> If you have a question about the signature requirement, please contact Jeff Elrod&nbsp;at the Elections Division by email at&nbsp;</strong></span><a href="mailto:jeff.elrod@sos.alabama.gov" target="_blank"><span style="background-color:white;color:#124b91;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>Jeff.Elrod@sos.alabama.gov</strong></span></a><span style="background-color:white;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lora&quot;,serif;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:normal;tab-stops:list .5in;"><strong>&nbsp;or by phone at 334-353-7177.</strong></span></li></ul><p>Municipal Resources</p><ul><li style="margin-bottom:11px;" data-list-item-id="e15253265f220a4761c51feab94b82f42"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026%20City%20of%20Montgomery%20Special%20Election%20FCPA%20Calendar.pdf">2026 City of Montgomery Special Election FCPA Filing Calendar</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e1b11542618420399fc6c544a416e8575"><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026MunicipalElectionFCPACalendar.pdf">2026 Municipal Election FCPA Filing Calendar</a></li></ul></blockquote><hr><h3>Special General Election House District 63 – January 13, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/State%20Certification%20of%20Democratic%20General%20Candidates%20HD%2063%2011.14.2025.pdf">State Certification of Democratic General Candidate</a> (certified by State 11/14/2025)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/State%20Certification%20of%20Republican%20General%20Candidates%20HD%2063%2011.14.2025.pdf">State Certification of Republican General Candidate</a> (certified by State 11/14/2025)</p><p>Unofficial Election Night Results (<a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/HouseDistrict-63-SpecialGeneralElection-UnofficialResults.xlsx">Excel file with vote totals</a>)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofGeneralElectionResults-HD-63.pdf">State Certification of General Election Results</a> (certified by State Canvassing Board 2/3/2026)</p></blockquote><hr><h3>Special General Election House District 38 – February 3, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofDemocraticGeneralCandidate-HD-38.pdf">State Certification of Democratic General Candidate</a> (certified by State 12/5/2025)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofRepublicanGeneralCandidate-HD-38.pdf">State Certification of Republican General Candidate</a> (certified by State 12/5/2025)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/State%20Certification%20of%20General%20Election%20Results.pdf">State Certification of General Election Results</a> (certified by State Canvassing Board 2/25/2026)</p></blockquote><hr><h3>Primary Election – May 19, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/alabama-votes/2026-primary-election-sample-ballots">Sample Ballots</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026RepublicanCertification.pdf">Republican Party Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 2/25/2026)</p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/election-2026/Democratic%20Certifcation.pdf">Democratic Party Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 2/26/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/Amended2026RepublicanCertification.pdf">Republican Party Amended Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 3/4/2026)</p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/election-2026/Amended2026DemocratCertification.pdf">Democratic Party Amended Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 3/4/2026)</p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026StateCertificationOfRepublicanCandidates.pdf">State Certification of Republican Candidates</a> (certified by State 3/6/2026)</p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026StateCertificationOfDemocraticCandidates.pdf">State Certification of Democratic Candidates</a> (certified by State 3/6/2026)</p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026StateCertificationOfStatewideAmendments.pdf">State Certification of Statewide Amendments</a> (certified by State 3/6/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/DemocraticPartyCertificationofCandidates2026PrimaryRunoff.pdf">Certification of Results - Democratic Party</a> (certified by party 5/27/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/RepublicanPartyCertificationofCandidates2026PrimaryNominee.pdf">Certification of Results - Republican Party</a> (certified by party 5/27/2026)</p><p>Certification of Results - Democratic Party (<a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026%20Democratic%20Primary%20Election%20Results.xlsx">Excel file with vote totals</a>) (certified by party 6/2/2026)</p><p>Certification of Results- Republican Party (<a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/05-29-2026/GOP%20Results.xlsx">Excel file with vote totals</a>) (certified by party 6/2/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/State%20Canvassing%20-%20Constitutional%20Amendments.pdf">State Certification of Constitutional Amendments</a> (certified by State Canvassing Board 6/10/2026)</p></blockquote><hr><h3>Primary Runoff Election – June 16, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/alabama-votes/2026-primary-runoff-election-sample-ballots">Sample Ballots</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/DemocraticPartyCertificationofCandidates2026PrimaryRunoff.pdf">Certification of Democratic Party Candidates</a> (certified by party on 5/27/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/RepublicanPartyCertificationofCandidates2026PrimaryRunoff.pdf">Certification of Republican Party Candidates</a> (certified by party on 5/27/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/AmendedDemocraticPartyCertificationofCandidates2026PrimaryRunoff.pdf">Amended Certification of Democratic Party Candidates</a> (certified by party on 5/27/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/CertificationofResults-RepublicanParty-PrimaryRunoff.pdf">Certification of Results - Republican Party</a> (certified by party 6/24/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/CertificationofResults-DemocraticParty-PrimaryRunoff.pdf">Certification of Results - Democratic Party</a> (certified by party 7/1/2026)</p><p>Certification of Results - Democratic Party (<a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026%20Democratic%20Primary%20Runoff%20Election%20Results.xlsx">Excel file with vote totals</a>) (certified by party 7/1/2026)</p></blockquote><hr><h3>Special Primary Election Congressional Districts 1, 2, 6, and 7 – August 11, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/alabama-votes/2026-special-primary-election-sample-ballots">Sample Ballots</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/Amended2026SpecialPrimaryElectionCalendar_05.27.2026.pdf">Special Primary Election Calendar</a></p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/06-03-2026/Republican%20Certification%20of%20Candidates.pdf">Republican Party Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 5/26/2026)</p><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/06-03-2026/Democratic%20Certification%20of%20Candidates.pdf">Democratic Party Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 5/26/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofDemocraticCandidatesCongressionalDistricts.pdf">State Certification of Democratic Candidates</a> (certified by State 6/3/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofRepublicanCandidatesCongressionalDistricts.pdf">State Certification of Republican Candidates</a> (certified by State 6/3/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/DemocraticCertificationofResultsforSpecialPrimary.pdf">Certification of Results - Democratic Party</a> (certified by party 8/24/2026)</p></blockquote><hr><h3>Special Primary Election State Senate Districts 25 and 26 – August 11, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/sites/default/files/05-29-2026/2026%20State%20Senate%20Special%20Primary%20Election%20Calendar%2005.29.2026.pdf">Special Primary Election Calendar</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/RepublicanCertificationofCandidates-SD25.pdf">Republican Party Certification of Candidates for State Senate District 25</a> (certified by Party 6/2/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/DemocratCertificationofCandidates-SD25and26.pdf">Democratic Party Certification of Candidates for State Senate District 25 and 26</a> (certified by Party 6/2/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofDemocraticCandidates-SD25and26.pdf">State Certification of Democratic Candidates</a> (certified by State 6/3/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/StateCertificationofRepublicanCandidates-SD25and26.pdf">State Certification of Republican Candidates</a> (certified by State 6/3/2026)</p></blockquote><hr><h3>General Election – November 3, 2026</h3><blockquote><p><a href="https://www.sos.alabama.gov/alabama-votes/2026-general-election-sample-ballots">Sample Ballots</a></p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/CertificationofRepublicanPartyCandidates-2026General.pdf">Certification of Republican Party Candidates</a> (certified by party 6/30/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/CertificationofDemocraticPartyCandidates-2026General.pdf">Certification of Democratic Party Candidates</a> (certified by party 7/1/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/AmendedCertificationofDemocraticPartyCandidates.pdf">Amended Certification of Democratic Party Candidates</a> (certified by party 8/24/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026GeneralElectionStateCertificationofConstitutionalAmendments.pdf">State Certification of Constitutional Amendments</a> (certified by State 8/26/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026GeneralElectionStateCertificationofDemocraticCandidates.pdf">State Certification of Democratic Party Candidates</a> (certified by State 8/26/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026GeneralElectionStateCertificationofRepublicanCandidates.pdf">State Certification of Republican Party Candidates</a> (certified by State 8/26/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/2026GeneralElection-StateCertificationofIndependentCandidate.pdf">State Certification of Independent Candidate</a> (certified by State 8/26/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/Amended_2026_Republican_Certification.pdf">Republican Party Amended Certification of Candidates</a> (received by Party 8/28/2026)</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/election-2026/ALGOPAmendedCertification-SD25.pdf">Republican Party Amended Certification of Candidates</a> (certified by Party 9/2/2026)</p></blockquote></div>
      
